        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Secret Paws - Cozy Offices</i> is a 3D hidden objects game where your mission is to find hidden cats in cozy offices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452270/extras/55086447d79391f94ae47b0c6713a0b1.poster.avif?t=1753362265\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452270/extras/55086447d79391f94ae47b0c6713a0b1.webm?t=1753362265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452270/extras/55086447d79391f94ae47b0c6713a0b1.mp4?t=1753362265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Open drawers, cabinets, and move objects to discover the most unexpected hiding spots. Every corner of the offices holds surprises and challenges as you explore a richly detailed isometric 3D environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452270/extras/907efb3ed065081fe132bd92a490557e.poster.avif?t=1753362265\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452270/extras/907efb3ed065081fe132bd92a490557e.webm?t=1753362265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452270/extras/907efb3ed065081fe132bd92a490557e.mp4?t=1753362265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative 3D hidden objects</strong>: An innovative game combining classic exploration mechanics with a 3D isometric environment. 🚀</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nearly 500 hidden cats</strong>: Find cats of all colors, sizes, and personalities. 😺</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret cats</strong>: Discover special cats in unique hiding spots. 💡</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed interactivity</strong>: Open furniture, move objects, and interact with the environment. 😻</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hint system</strong>: Use hints to highlight a random cat when you're struggling. 🔎</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452270/extras/c1c721282b4048ffac68f03f94b1b58a.poster.avif?t=1753362265\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452270/extras/c1c721282b4048ffac68f03f94b1b58a.webm?t=1753362265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452270/extras/c1c721282b4048ffac68f03f94b1b58a.mp4?t=1753362265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to prove you're the master at finding cats?</p>",
