ong>: Find cats of all colors, sizes, and personalities. 😺</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret cats</strong>: Discover special cats in unique hiding spots. 💡</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed interactivity</strong>: Open furniture, move objects, and interact with the environment. 😻</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hint system</strong>: Use hints to highlight a random cat when you're struggling. 🔎</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452270/extras/c1c721282b4048ffac68f03f94b1b58a.poster.avif?t=1753362265\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452270/extras/c1c721282b4048ffac68f03f94b1b58a.webm?t=1753362265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452270/extras/c1c721282b4048ffac68f03f94b1b58a.mp4?t=1753362265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to prove you're the master at finding cats?</p>",
